  "description": "Mobile brain/body imaging (MoBI) dataset of scalp EEG recorded during split-belt treadmill walking to study cortical activity related to locomotor adaptation. Thirty participants completed abrupt and gradual split-belt walking paradigms with a 2:1 belt speed ratio.",
